<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus to auction 91-day t-bills worth 20 million.</title>
<headline>Cyprus to auction 91-day t-bills worth 20 million.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's central bank will auction 91-day treasury bills worth up to 20 million pounds ($38.9 million) with a June 11 issue date, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Competitive or non-competitive bids can be made for the issue from June 9 to June 11 at 0900 local (0600 GMT). ($1 = 0.514 pounds)</p>
</text>
